cle distributed under the terms of the Creative Commons Public Domain declaration which stipulates that, once placed in the public domain, this work may be freely reproduced, distributed, transmitted, modified, built upon, or otherwise used by anyone for any lawful purpose.</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2007</copyright-year><related-article xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pmed.0040074" related-article-type="corrected-article" xlink:title="Policy Forum" vol="4" page="e74" id="N0x8d80df0N0x8cd5e38" ext-link-type="doi"><article-title>Addressing the Global Neglect of Childhood Hearing Impairment in Developing Countries</article-title></related-article><counts><page-count count="1"/></counts><custom-meta-wrap><custom-meta><meta-name>citation</meta-name><meta-value>(2007) Correction: Addressing the Global Neglect of Childhood Hearing Impairment in Developing Countries. PLoS Med 4(6): e203. doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pmed.0040203">10.1371/journal.pmed.0040203</ext-link></meta-value></custom-meta></custom-meta-wrap></article-meta></front><body><p>In <italic>PLoS Medicine</italic>, volume 4, issue 4, doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pmed.0040074">10.1371/journal.pmed.0040074</ext-link>:</p><p>The author inadvertently omitted the following citation that addresses the same topic (at the time of publication of the <italic>PLoS Medicine</italic> article, the article in <italic>The Lancet</italic> was still in press):</p><p>Olusanya BO, Newton VE (2007) Global burden of childhood hearing impairment and disease control priorities for developing countries. Lancet 369: 1314&#x02013;1317.</p><p>The author did, however, cite this <italic>Lancet</italic> paper, as reference &#x0005b;10&#x0005d;, in an earlier Correspondence article published in <italic>PLoS Medicine</italic>: Olusanya BO (2007) &#x0201c;The Right Stuff&#x0201d;: The Global Burden of Disease. PLoS Med 4(2): e84. doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pmed.0040084">10.1371/journal.pmed.0040084</ext-link></p></body></article>